    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "description": "Rotas públicas de registro e login.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"user@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"secret123\",\n  \"name\": \"Lucca\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "register"]
            },
            "description": "Cria um usuário. Retorna `201` com o usuário criado.\n\n**Body** (registerSchema):\n- `email` — string, formato de e-mail (obrigatório)\n- `password` — string, mínimo 6 caracteres (obrigatório)\n- `name` — string, mínimo 2 caracteres (obrigatório)"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "// Salva o JWT na variável de coleção para os demais requests.",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "    if (data.token) {",
                  "        pm.collectionVariables.set('token', data.token);",
                  "    }",
                  "    if (data.user && data.user.id) {",
                  "        pm.collectionVariables.set('userId', String(data.user.id));",
                  "    }",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"user@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"secret123\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "Autentica e retorna `{ token, user }`.\n\nO script da aba **Tests** grava `token` e `userId` nas variáveis da coleção.\n\n**Body** (loginSchema):\n- `email` — string, formato de e-mail (obrigatório)\n- `password` — string (obrigatório)"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
